Subject: [PATCH 69/71] Restore UZDoom's README; describe the Switch 2 branch
 in README-SWITCH2.md

RDoom NX had replaced UZDoom's README (with links to donations). The
official README is back unchanged; the port is described, with credits and
without donation links, in README-SWITCH2.md.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 README-SWITCH2.md |  21 +++++++++
 README.md         | 110 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 110 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 README-SWITCH2.md

diff --git a/README-SWITCH2.md b/README-SWITCH2.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..09e115ccd2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/README-SWITCH2.md
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# UZDoom NX2 — engine branch
+
+Branch `uzdoom-nx2`: official **UZDoom 5.0.3** (tag `5.0.3`,
+`7910df7102033fd7754a317f3254f24101135926`) with the patches that port it to
+the **Nintendo Switch 2** under kaiHEN (homebrew `.nro`), rendered with
+**Vulkan** through OunceVK on libounce. Build, install and safety notes are in
+the main UZDoom NX2 repository (`README.md`, `docs/SECURITY.md`).
+
+The series starts with the Switch 1 port of RDoom NX by Renan (Æon)
+(github.com/aeon1911/RDoom-NX-engine, GPL-3.0), followed by the Switch 2
+commits:
+
+- libounce + OunceVK, VI2 display window, 1920×1080 swapchain;
+- SD card write firewall (`src/common/platform/posix/nx/nx2_fsguard.c`) and
+  path policy (`nx2_pathpolicy.c`): writes only in `sdmc:/switch/uzdoom-nx2`,
+  the NAND is never opened;
+- English by default, French and Portuguese for the port's screens.
+
+Stock clocks only: no overclocking code.
+
+License: GPL-3.0, like UZDoom (see `LICENSE` and `docs/licenses/`).
